<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-20T13:43:44.245Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:43:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Priest Patricio Alfredo Sánchez Molinari was killed when a wall-mounted crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Guayaquil, Ecuador. U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support anti-drug operations in Colombia and Ecuador and conducting sea strikes that seize crews and destroy boats. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation produced 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust, and nightly curfews were imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxON0diRWtYOVBGX2ZQZVlER3ZTWkZjYmtYSFAydUs2eFQ1NzM2NWZNRFlSci13Slg1V1VPa1N1YTBUWGZWZG5IbDJkUzgzX3hONm9jUTh2Z1paUWNGOHBzUGhrcXE4UjNOblp4WDlVcVJZLWFqajVLT212WTBNM1F1VHRQSGdGQzhqNUVJbkw0c1Nkc0Vl?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWkJhby1YQmdVN1BOWmJoZjREZy04c05lWUM0OG91c0tycWNnYTF1QVdOQ0Y1eFVzUmpKT1p0RUJueWVkSGdHdDZMLVE1eE5lNnVTMlBBbXFoa3doc0s2d1dpV1ZXckc4NVJxMkJLRDg0N2ZiMFdrdzNQMERkX0NpWlNISl9ab3FYVlhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQODBMY056RXdBUUhkeEpSUWZnN1Y4T2lTV3U0RnREeUVSV2taNzVwbjFjbFBYeFBNLXpsRGZlVUhzWHRzS3hyN1dkcnZWZHU5bHE4elJWNXhDV1ZEdmpXdDVRU2NfRnB5QXhZb3hkcmZrU3RqZFRYQ2s5al9XWVYzU1Rma1hCOTVyUHFMRzI2YTdqVGxFTmc4Zy1Zc2tHQzZTZWdzb2VFakhzakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxObS1RRUc3Qmo5WHZhSTVhclVHMzdEVzYwNmphd19GNFVHcGd6UVlmU2tOTDZVdXA2Y0V4MjFPVXRLS0tXQ0ZqeVEtczAwV3dCTUVsVFo2UHVvSWpuVXNoT0k0VzNlcnNDZzg1WW50MXBIaUxnWURacHY2VFNQNFlmckJ3enh0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo